","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/OUDSTheme":{"title":"OUDSTheme","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/oudstheme","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the base theme that all themes must inherit from."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A Swift "},{"code":"class","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has been used so as to allow to easily override some attributes and have inheritance, without having for developers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to implement all tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Any properties of an overridable theme should be defined so as to provide defaults values."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"We allow this theme to be derivated and be overridden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be seen as a kind of “abstract class” in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"object oriented paradigm","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme contract"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" is not a ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"final","type":"text"}]},{"text":" class, its type cannot be seen as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":", that is the reason why this conformity